      "statement": "This binding internal guidance governs the US taxable fixed-income sleeve for US taxable client accounts—US Treasuries, agency MBS, investment-grade corporates, and municipal credit—while non-US sovereign and emerging-market debt remain governed by the multi-asset sleeve guidance.",
