      "id": "claim_a0f3f4b4098f4a80a65ed6d1d0b15768",
      "statement": "For top federal marginal-bracket clients, municipal credit has a 22% target against an 18% neutral weight, while clients below the top bracket remain at the 18% neutral municipal weight without the private-activity concentration.",
